Linus,

please pull second ALSA fixes for v2.6.30-rc7 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

This contains a couple of machine-specific quirks and a fix (or
workaround) for regressions due to the strict DMA pointer check.
Hopefully this should be the last pull request for the sound
subsystem...


Thanks!

Takashi

===

Clemens Ladisch (1):
      sound: usb-audio: make the MotU Fastlane work again

Takashi Iwai (2):
      ALSA: Fix invalid jiffies check after pause
      ALSA: Enable PCM hw_ptr_jiffies check only in xrun_debug mode

Tony Vroon (1):
      ALSA: hda - Compaq Presario CQ60 patching for Conexant

